              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 132.0.2 (release)/133/135\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://zs.thnet.gov.cn/index\n2. Try scrolling using the mouse wheel.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe page can be scrolled.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nUnable to scroll the page.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:defcf026-8dc3-41e0-b351-12dfa8254fe1",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
